==English==
{{wikipedia|Child's Play (disambiguation)|Child's Play}}

===Etymology===
Cognate with {{cog|de|Kinderspiel}}, {{cog|fr|jeu d'enfant}}, {{cog|it|gioco da bambini}}, {{cog|it|gioco da ragazzi}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|en-au-child's play.ogg|Audio (AU)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[child]]'s [[play]]|-}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} Something particularly [[simple]] or [[easy]].
#: ''Compared to my last job, this is '''child's play'''.''
# {{&lit|en|the '''[[play]]''' of a '''[[child]]'''}}

